# Phenom Engineering Context

This repo (`Phenom - Engineering/`) is a **read-only local reference** of Phenom engineering repos, used to answer feasibility and "how does this work" questions without asking engineering first.

## Hard rules

- **Never edit, commit, or push anything under `repos/`.** Those are live engineering repos cloned for reading only. Treat any write request targeting `repos/` as out of scope — flag it instead of executing it.
- Don't pull personal coaching content, 1:1 notes, or private context from `Personal - AI Product Leader/` into this repo.
- Don't copy full source files out into other repos in this workspace — cite file paths and line numbers instead.

## Where to start

Always read `CLAUDE.md` in this folder first — it has the full workflow. In short: `index/taxonomy.md` → `index/capability-map.md` → the relevant domain file under `index/` → then the code under `repos/`.

## Source of truth for team routing

`Phenom - Product Copilot/policies/platform-routing.md` is the source of truth for which platform team owns a capability. This repo's `index/capability-map.md` maps the same capabilities to code locations — keep them consistent; don't invent a second routing table here.
